.th NOHUP I 5/31/77
.sh NAME
nohup \*- run a command immune to hangups
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd nohup
command [ arguments ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Nohup
executes
.it command
with hangups,
quits and interrupts all ignored.
If output is not re-directed by the user,
it will be sent to
.it /dev/null
(a ``write-only'' file).
.sh "SEE ALSO"
nice(I), signal(II)
